    "Jump/01 is rising, 02 apex, 03 falling; 00 and 04 are takeoff and landing. Physics moves the root.",
    "Skill uses a short fiery sword dash. Compact flame is confined to the blade; gameplay supplies contact effects.",
    "Cockpit poses use the same floor-root convention for convenience; place/scale these explicitly inside the cockpit."
